{"site":"douban","sid":"1297874","imdb_id":"tt0033870","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0033870/","douban_link":"https://movie.douban.com/subject/1297874/","chinese_title":"马耳他之鹰","foreign_title":"The Maltese Falcon","year":"1941","aka":["枭巢喋血战","枭巢喋血记","群雄夺宝鹰","马尔他雄鹰"],"region":["美国"],"genre":["悬疑","犯罪","黑色电影"],"language":["英语"],"playdate":["1941-10-03(美国)"],"episodes":"","duration":"101分钟","description":"萨姆·斯佩德（亨弗莱·鲍嘉 Humphrey Bogart 饰）和搭档阿切尔在旧金山市开了一家侦探事务所。一天，一位贵妇（玛丽·阿斯特 Mary Astor 饰）登门拜访，委托他们寻找自己失踪的妹妹。他们立刻展开调查，发现这名贵妇的妹妹与一位叫做瑟斯的神秘男子在一起。本 来以为这只是一件普通的失踪案，但是事情的发展出乎他们所料。阿切尔在调查案件时被杀害，传说的瑟斯也相继被杀，警方由此怀疑起萨姆与阿切尔的妻子有染而杀掉他的合伙人。深陷泥潭的萨姆依然继续调查案情，他查出贵妇曾与古特曼等流氓倒卖过古玩，之后，古特曼又拜托萨姆帮忙寻找一尊雕像——被称作“马耳他之鹰”的无价之宝。萨姆开始研究起这尊神秘的雕像，结果发现真相就藏在其中。\n本片获得第14届奥斯卡最佳影片、最佳男配角、最佳剧本提名奖。","poster":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l_ratio_poster/public/p2202798912.jpg","douban_votes":"16881","douban_rating":"7.4","imdb_rating_average":"7.9","imdb_votes":"175350","imdb_rating":"7.9 / 10 from 175,350 users","director":[{"name":"约翰·休斯顿 John Huston","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27230972/","role":"导演 Director","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p5181.webp"}],"writer":[{"name":"约翰·休斯顿 John Huston","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27230972/","role":"编剧 Writer","avatar":"https://img2.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p5181.webp"},{"name":"达希尔·哈米特 Dashiell Hammett","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27224245/","role":"原著作者 Based on","avatar":"https://img3.doubanio.com/view/personage/m/public/eef35ee13fe5c8ddf1c6b25dd462b65f.jpg"}],"cast":[{"name":"亨弗莱·鲍嘉 Humphrey Bogart","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27253744/","role":"演员 Actor","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1587808427.29.webp"},{"name":"玛丽·阿斯特 Mary Astor","link":"https://www.douban.com/personage/27254003/","role":"演员 Actress","avatar":"https://img1.doubanio.com/view/celebrity/m/public/p1388571101.19.webp"},{"name":"格拉黛丝·乔治 Gladys George","link":"https://www